 paper-mode canvas (a `reading.yaml` with its shots) exists in this workspace; the worked example the\nskill names (`Knowledge-Base/.../salvi-2024-gpt4-persuasion/`) is not here. Read mode is drawn from its spec and\ncode, not from a measured run.", "originalText": "⏳ later: No paper-mode canvas (a `reading.yaml` with its shots) exists in this workspace; the worked example the\nskill names (`Knowledge-Base/.../salvi-2024-gpt4-persuasion/`) is not here. Read mode is drawn from its spec and\ncode, not from a measured run.", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-2903db8bd90a", "type": "text", "x": 7687.5, "y": 1715.3125, "width": 1344.437890625, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6b1fd4c925b8", "roundness": null, "seed": 108, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 108, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "⏳ later: Read mode has no timing like s21's seconds per rebuild; should one paper read be measured?", "originalText": "⏳ later: Read mode has no timing like s21's seconds per rebuild; should one paper read be measured?", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-c0006b65001d", "type": "rectangle", "x": 8512.5, "y": 420.0, "width": 687.5, "height": 92.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-6b1fd4c925b8", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 109, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 109, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": fa