 lives: its folder"}, {"id": "kept_s-07fb4a40b856", "type": "text", "x": 2475.0, "y": 2277.1875, "width": 1609.8503906250003, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 113, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 113, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "📁 Where it lives: a skill folder, read from disk", "originalText": "📁 Where it lives: a skill folder, read from disk", "fontSize": 75, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-c18946b8d41a", "type": "text", "x": 2475.0, "y": 2387.1875, "width": 1299.628515625, "height": 32.8125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 114, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 114, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A real folder, so a folder tree. Yellow, the key point: the two modes' scripts and their yaml specs sit in ref/.", "originalText": "A real folder, so a folder tree. Yellow, the key point: the two modes' scripts and their yaml specs sit in ref/.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-dc539b2836e7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2475.0, "y": 2494.6875, "width": 1375.0, "height": 387.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 115, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 115, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-fe84f5ee1d8c", "type": "text", "x": 2512.5, "y": 2532.1875, "width": 1175.0, "height": 300.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 116, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 116, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "excalidraw-read/\n├── CHANGELOG.md     its versions\n├── SKILL.md         the rules\n├── agents/          Codex's card, 1 files\n└── ref/             the contracts\n    ├── read_paper.py    read mode: text, boxes, shoot, draw, all\n    ├── reading-spec.md  the reading.yaml an agent writes\n    └── topic_drawing.py", "originalText": "excalidraw-read/\n├── CHANGELOG.md     its versions\n├── SKILL.md         the rules\n├── agents/          Codex's card, 1 files\n└── ref/             the contracts\n    ├── read_paper.py    read mode: text, boxes, shoot, draw, all\n    ├── reading-spec.md  the reading.yaml an agent writes\n    └── topic_drawing.py", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-d4cc28ca1e4a", "type": "text", "x": 2475.0, "y": 2919.6875, "width": 485.457421875, "height": 40.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 117, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 117, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Its helpers are not in this folder:", "originalText": "Its helpers are not in this folder:", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-6eeb02fa554c", "type": "text", "x": 2500.0, "y": 2969.6875, "width": 1128.537890625, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 118, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 118, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· Its drawing helpers are not here: canvas.write and render_png.py are haipipe-studio's.", "originalText": "· Its drawing helpers are not here: canvas.write and render_png.py are haipipe-studio's.", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-a096c422e647", "type": "text", "x": 2500.0, "y": 3014.0625, "width": 801.11796875, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 119, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 119, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· Its look is excalidraw-studio's: this topic follows its principles.", "originalText": "· Its look is excalidraw-studio's: this topic follows its principles.", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-7afd18b3e8fa", "type": "text", "x": 2475.0, "y": 3083.4375, "width": 1343.7675781250002, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 120, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 120, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A skill folder: SKILL.md says how, ref/ holds the two modes' scripts and the specs of their yaml.", "originalText": "A skill folder: SKILL.md says how, ref/ holds the two modes' scripts and the specs of their yaml.", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-961bf32a4dc5", "type": "text", "x": 3950.0, "y": 2494.6875, "width": 846.644140625, "height": 46.875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 121, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 121, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What each script says about itself (its docstring)", "originalText": "What each script says about itself (its docstring)", "fontSize": 38, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-1d98b5adec47", "type": "text", "x": 3950.0, "y": 2554.6875, "width": 473.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 122, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "read_paper.py · 1131 lines", "originalText": "read_paper.py · 1131 lines", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-fa257e9db204", "type": "text", "x": 3975.0, "y": 2594.6875, "width": 1355.319921875, "height": 68.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 123, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 123, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Read one paper's PDF onto an Excalidraw canvas: its logic, its key passages shot with the quoted words\nhighlighted, a comment on each, and how each links to our paper (excalidraw-read).", "originalText": "Read one paper's PDF onto an Excalidraw canvas: its logic, its key passages shot with the quoted words\nhighlighted, a comment on each, and how each links to our paper (excalidraw-read).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-b63ac28b8b5f", "type": "text", "x": 3950.0, "y": 2680.9375, "width": 491.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 124, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 124, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "read_revise.py · 1360 lines", "originalText": "read_revise.py · 1360 lines", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-f52c0a9d266f", "type": "text", "x": 3975.0, "y": 2720.9375, "width": 1355.1957031250001, "height": 240.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-500825e7e38e", "roundness": null, "seed": 125, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 125, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Read a file we revise (a co-author's Word file, through the PDF Word makes of it) section by section: one\npicture per section cut from the PDF, the words each planned change touches under a see-through red\nbox, the updated draft's new words under a green one, and a note per change: the change, why, and in\nred the evidence needed and who can answer, written smaller than the pages. The plan in one picture\ncomes first (excalidraw-revise; JL 261011: \"take screen shot of the pdf version for each section and then\nsay what to modify and what to change\"; its own skill since 261013, out of excalidraw-read, whose\npage-cutting helpers it still draws with).", "originalText": "Read a file we revise (a co-author's Word file, through the PDF Word makes of it) section by section: one\npicture per section cut from the PDF, the words each planned change touches under a see-through red\nbox, the updated draft's new words under a green one, and a note per change: the change, why, and in\nred the evidence needed and who can answer, written smaller than the pages. The plan in one picture\ncomes first (excalidraw-revise; JL 261011: \"take screen shot of the pdf version for each section and then\nsay what to modify and what to change\"; its own skill since 261013, out of excalidraw-read, whose\npage-cutting helpers it still draws with).", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-48c117406257", "type": "text", "x": 3950.0, "y": 2979.0625, "width": 509.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, 